  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Communication and Visibility of the European Union in Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall objective&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To strengthen communication on the shared values between the European Union and Cabo Verde, the mutual benefits of the Special Partnership, and the priorities for political dialogue and bilateral cooperation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To communicate proactively about the values, interests and benefits of the Special Partnership, highlighting the role of the European Union as Cabo Verde&#xbf;s political and strategic ally;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To integrate a &lt;strong&gt;Team Europe&lt;/strong&gt; approach in communication, giving visibility to Team Europe Initiatives and to the EU&#xbf;s &lt;strong&gt;Global Gateway Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;To communicate relevant actions in a simple, appropriate and audience-adapted way.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
